T1  - Integrating Ambient In-Home Sensor Data and Electronic Health Record Data for the Prediction of Outcomes in Amyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis: Protocol for an Exploratory Feasibility Study
AU  - Janes, William E
AU  - Marchal, Noah
AU  - Song, Xing
AU  - Popescu, Mihail
AU  - Mosa, Abu Saleh Mohammad
